data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":95,"item_id":"rs_02645fc52cf533cd016acad51023f08190837ba91be8a8fb7f","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Examining test UI needs**\n\nI need to create a UI for tests that has no dependencies by utilizing a virtual machine (VM) and a fake DOM. There's enough time to extract elements, like renderTasks, via a script without throwing in unnecessary render calls. I’m considering running a full test with a render stub instead. My focus is to implement various elements in the DOM while ensuring robust tests that support tasks and forms. A lightweight fake DOM with a generic parser is the goal!"}

